OL,3,GNEWSAStudent officer in court accused
OL,4,Aof rape and kidnap
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student police officer accused of
OL,7,Frape and kidnap has appeared in court
OL,8,Fvia videolink.
OL,10,FMohammad Hassan, 23, who has been
OL,11,Fsuspended by Greater Manchester Police
OL,12,F(GMP), made a brief appearance at
OL,13,FManchester Crown Court.
OL,15,FThe defendant, from Failsworth, Greater
OL,16,FManchester, was arrested after an
OL,17,Fincident on 8 August, when he was off
OL,18,Fduty. He was later charged with kidnap,
OL,19,Frape, a sexual assault, intentional
OL,20,Fstrangulation, theft and dangerous
OL,21,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
